## Steps to reproduce
On the baseline in Runtime or environment, build a workbook with one conditional format and one data validation, write it, and read it back with `read_xlsx`. The conditional format covers the 12,000 cells `A1` through `A12000`, each as its own range, and uses a greater-than cell rule. The validation covers `B1` through `B12000` the same way. This run used package `gridcraft-xlsx` in the cargo test profile.

